-        $$ \text{sample}.a = \text{colorValue}.a \times uOpacityVal \times \frac{1.0}{uStepsI} $$
-    *   Compute sample RGB contribution:
-        $$ \text{sample}.rgb = (1.0 - \text{accum}.a) \times \text{hsv2rgb}(\text{colorValue}.rgb) \times \text{sample}.a $$
